			"date": "2020-03-17T15:11:53.000Z",
			"content": "The key is that the HTML is hand-authored, not generated by a tool based on presumptions. Having to hand-author HTML means every choice you make is intentional and specific to your site's needs.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/briankardell\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleventy\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
